---
import Stub from '../layouts/Stub.astro'
import { NAP, LINKS } from '../lib/site'
---

<Stub
  title="Kickboxing & Fitness Classes in Boise, ID | Bodies in Motion"
  description="Kickboxing and strength training (SGX) classes at Bodies in Motion in Boise, Idaho. Try a trial offer of 3 kickboxing classes."
  path="/fitness-classes"
  h1="Boise Kickboxing & Fitness Classes"
  eyebrow="Empowered"
>
  <p>
    Bodies in Motion offers fitness kickboxing and strength training (SGX) classes for men and women of all experience
    levels. Kickboxing classes are 60 minutes, and the skills taught are designed to be fun and easy to grasp. Bodies
    in Motion is also a MyZone enabled facility, so you can track your heart rate, zone, and calorie expenditure in
    real time at no extra monthly charge.
  </p>
  <!-- TODO(Duncan): the old pages disagree on the kickboxing trial price ($19.99 on /kickboxing, $29 on /kickboxing-trial), so no price is shown. Add the correct one. -->
  <p>
    The kickboxing trial offer includes 3 high-energy classes and a brand-new pair of boxing gloves. To sign up for the
    trial, <a href={LINKS.calendlyKickboxing}>book on Calendly</a> or call <a href={NAP.phoneTel}>{NAP.phoneDisplay}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Class times</h2>
  <ul class="bullets">
    <li>Monday, Wednesday, Friday: Kickboxing at 5:45 am, 7:00 am, 12:15 pm and 6:15 pm</li>
    <li>Tuesday and Thursday: Strength Training (SGX) at 12:15 pm</li>
    <li>Saturday: Kickboxing at 9 am</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Open play is free for your kids while you exercise. <a href="/open-play">See open play</a>.</p>
  <div class="stub-actions">
    <a class="btn-primary" href={NAP.phoneTel}>Call {NAP.phoneDisplay}</a>
    <a class="btn-outline" href="/hours">See all hours</a>
  </div>
</Stub>
